# Scenario 'title_settings': title screen -> モバイルせってい (mobile settings) menu, every entry:
#   1. パスワードの変更 (change password): explanations, current password, new password twice, dial 9477,
#      HTTP POST /cgi-bin/mgb/daa_gb_pwdchg.cgi -> the fake server answers 404 -> error 32-404
#   2. ご利用時間の確認 (usage time): current password, POST /cgi-bin/mgb/daa_gb_jikan.cgi -> 404 -> error 32-404
#   3. ご利用額の確認 (usage fee):  password, GET /cgb/utility?request=summary -> 404 -> error 32-404
#   4. 登録情報の削除 (delete registration): two confirmations, then the adapter EEPROM is cleared
# Starts from the state left by 'tutorial_profile' (password is "aZ01" as typed by 'register'), fake Internet on.
# All screen names are from reading the Japanese screens (screenshots), not from the code.
wait 400                     # boot
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A                        # title screen: menu スタート / モバイルせってい
waitstable 60 max 600
shot title_menu
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A                        # モバイルせってい
waitstable 60 max 600
shot settings_menu
# --- 1. change password
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot pw_change_explain
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot pw_current_keyboard
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot pw_new_keyboard
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x2
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot pw_new_confirm
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x2
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
shot pw_change_confirm_dial
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot pw_change_connecting
wait 300
waitstable 60 max 900
shot pw_change_error
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 90
shot settings_menu_again
# --- 2. usage time
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot time_explain
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot time_confirm
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot time_password_keyboard
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 300
waitstable 60 max 900
shot time_error
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 90
shot menu_after_time
# --- 3. usage fee
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot fee_explain
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot fee_confirm
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot fee_password_keyboard
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x5
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap RIGHT x1
tap A
tap START
wait 20
tap A
waitstable 60 max 300
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 300
waitstable 60 max 900
shot fee_error
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 90
shot menu_after_fee
# --- 4. delete registration
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot del_explain_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot del_explain_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot del_confirm
tap LEFT
wait 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot del_reconfirm
tap LEFT
wait 30
tap A                        # really delete: the adapter EEPROM is cleared
waitstable 60 max 900
shot del_done_1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot del_done_2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot del_done_3
wait 600
shot end
